advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Peasants}

Summons Peasants to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Peasants summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Peasants.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Peasants}

Summons Peasants to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Peasants summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Peasants.
